  "description": "WabiSabi implements the WabiSabi anonymous-credential (KVAC over secp256k1)\n        protocol. The package ships two interchangeable implementations behind an\n        identical API: the pure-managed `WabiSabi`, and the native-backed\n        `WabiSabi.Native` (P/Invoke over the libwabisabi C library, with pre-built\n        binaries for linux-x64, linux-arm64, win-x64, osx-x64 and osx-arm64).",
